WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,150
This time I found Ho San.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,670
It's impossible to be harmed enough to stay there, right?

3
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:12,570
No

4
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,890
I've found Ho San myself

5
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:17,300
I can stay here until I go back, brother

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,020
I'll just come out and refresh myself.

7
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:25,860
Carrying a baggage to support private thieves

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:47,910
If I had known earlier, I would have dialed the timetable.

9
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:52,130
Come out on your own, sister

10
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:53,330
You shout again
